# Managed Tor client: the downloaded bundle and tor's own data (docs/proxy-and-tor.md)
/server/tor/runtime/

# The user's own predefined page_eval scripts (docs/predefined-scripts.md). The folder ships
# empty so it is always there; its contents are the user's and survive every update.
/custom-scripts/*
!/custom-scripts/.gitkeep

